# Backend environment (Flask) — Mishra Transport Agency
#
# The app reads only PORT and CACHE_FILE from the environment
# (see vehicle_api.py). Flask does NOT auto-load this file — it documents
# what to set where.
#
# Render: set these in the dashboard (render.yaml already defines
# FLASK_ENV and CACHE_FILE there). PORT is injected by Render automatically.
#
# Local dev: prefix on the command line instead:
#   PORT=5001 python vehicle_api.py

# Local development (frontend expects the backend on :5001):
# PORT=5001

# Render dashboard values:
# FLASK_ENV=production
# CACHE_FILE=/tmp/vehicle_cache.json
